cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite the paper below."
title: "QAAF: Quality-Aware Adaptive Fusion"
abstract: >-
  Code for "Quality-Aware Multimodal Fusion Reveals Implicit Identity in
  Valence-Arousal Features". Quality-aware gating and adaptive modality dropout
  for multimodal valence-arousal estimation, and the verification experiments
  that probe the resulting representations for identity information.
type: software

